            "notes": "We can now choose the power  [Track and Field](item_b3750fe4-e416-42b6-ad9e-fe92c7dcffc5) and start to use the biotic field heal as a powerfull sustain for the team constantly (if you keep running). To do this we also choose  [Battery Pack](item_5ff8a68c-8f07-4531-9050-5cc5d9128b77) and [Rapid Response Radius](item_18720a42-a523-4dbc-9114-891c37a79331) this gives us a much larger and longer lasting biotic field. \n\nThe only issue is that we are a damage character and while running solider can't do any damage as we don't have  [Back Off](item_cf806fa3-c276-4898-a092-7d7f1a908821) yet. So try to heal when your team really needs is and for the remainder focus on doing damage with your rockets untill we get to round 5.",
